{"session_id":"90a7739b-ff02-4fdf-acb3-86ee4950d316","transcript_path":"/home/sameer/.claude/projects/-home-sameer-hash-shit-8x/90a7739b-ff02-4fdf-acb3-86ee4950d316.jsonl","cwd":"/home/sameer/hash-shit/8x","prompt_id":"75daeeab-9d9b-4f00-8334-1c8dbb87fa8f","permission_mode":"default","effort":{"level":"high"},"hook_event_name":"Stop","stop_hook_active":false,"last_assistant_message":"The inference server is a **FastAPI relay** that routes image generation requests to providers like Pollinations.ai. Here's how to run it:\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\ncd inference\n\n# 1. Create virtual environment (first time only)\npython -m venv .venv\nsource .venv/bin/activate\n\n# 2. Install dependencies (first time only)\npip install -r requirements.txt\n\n# 3. Configure environment\ncp .env.example .env\n\n# 4. Run the server\nuvicorn main:app --reload --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000\n```\n\n## Available Endpoints\n\nOnce running, the API is available at:\n\n| Endpoint | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| `GET /` | API info |\n| `GET /health` | Health check + provider status |\n| `GET /docs` | Swagger UI |\n| `GET /inference/models` | List available models |\n| `GET /inference/providers` | List registered providers |\n| `POST /inference/image?model=flux` | Generate an image |\n\n## Generate an Image (Example)\n\n```bash\ncurl -X POST \"http://localhost:8000/inference/image?model=flux\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: your_api_key\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"prompt\": \"a cat in space wearing an astronaut helmet\",\n    \"width\": 1024,\n    \"height\": 1024,\n    \"seed\": 42,\n    \"negative_prompt\": \"blurry, low quality\",\n    \"nologo\": true,\n    \"private\": false\n  }'\n```\n\n## Supported Image Models\n\n- `flux` — default high-quality model\n- `turbo` — fast generation\n- `any-dark` — optimized for dark themes\n\nAll three are free-tier via Pollinations.ai (no API key required for basic usage).\n\n## Run Tests\n\n```bash\npytest tests/ -v\n```\n\n---\n\n**TL;DR:** `cd inference && source .venv/bin/activate && uvicorn main:app --reload`","background_tasks":[],"session_crons":[]}

