video generation returns an error.\n\n---\n\n### Default Models\n\n| Variable | Default | Required? | Used In |\n|----------|---------|-----------|---------|\n| `DEFAULT_IMAGE_MODEL` | `flux` | No | `relay.py` — default when no model is specified |\n| `DEFAULT_VIDEO_MODEL` | `json2video` | No | `relay.py` — default when no model is specified |\n| `DEFAULT_TEXT_MODEL` | `None` | No | `relay.py` — placeholder for future text generation |\n| `DEFAULT_ENHANCE_MODEL` | `None` | No | `relay.py` — placeholder for future image enhancement |\n\n---\n\n### Request Limits\n\n| Variable | Default | Required? | Used In |\n|----------|---------|-----------|---------|\n| `REQUEST_TIMEOUT` | `60` | No | `providers/pollinations.py`, `providers/json2video.py` — HTTP request timeout (seconds) |\n| `MAX_IMAGE_WIDTH` | `2048` | No | (loaded in config but not actively enforced in code) |\n| `MAX_IMAGE_HEIGHT` | `2048` | No | (loaded in config but not actively enforced in code) |\n| `MAX_IMAGE_SEED` | `999999` | No | (loaded in config but not actively enforced in code) |\n\n---\n\n### CORS\n\n| Variable | Default | Required? | Used In |\n|----------|---------|-----------|---------|\n| `CORS_ORIGINS` | `http://localhost:3000` | No | `main.py` — comma-separated allowed origins for CORS |\n\n> Example: `CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,http://localhost:5173,https://yourdomain.com`\n\n---\n\n## Complete .env Template for Inference\n\n```bash\n# Server\nAPP_HOST=0.0.0.0\nAPP_PORT=8000\nAPP_DEBUG=false\n\n# Pollinations.ai (image generation)\nPOLLINATIONS_BASE_URL=https://image.pollinations.ai\nPOLLINATIONS_API_KEY=your_api_key_here\n\n# JSON2Video (video generation)\nJSON2VIDEO_BASE_URL=https://api.json2video.com/v1\nJSON2VIDEO_API_KEY=your_json2video_key_here\n\n# Default models\nDEFAULT_IMAGE_MODEL=flux\nDEFAULT_VIDEO_MODEL=json2video\nDEFAULT_TEXT_MODEL=\nDEFAULT_ENHANCE_MODEL=\n\n# Limits\nREQUEST_TIMEOUT=60\nMAX_IMAGE_WIDTH=2048\nMAX_IMAGE_HEIGHT=2048\nMAX_IMAGE_SEED=999999\n\n# CORS\nC